You could use `std::format`

```
const auto chassisPrefix =
    (chassisNumber == 0) ? "SC0-" :
                           std::format("N{:02}-", chassisNumber - 1);

return std::format("{}{}{}", locationCodePrefix, chassisPrefix, locationCode);
```

Can we make this a utility API (perhaps in log_id, something like getBMCChassisPosition())?

I believe we may eventually need to obtain the running BMC chassis position through D-Bus, but for now this approach is fine with me.

@spinler@us.ibm.com, do you have any thoughts on this?
